# Context Awareness — Sage AI

## What this is

Expertise locator / prior-art concierge. Java `:8080` owns ask orchestration (ADK + Ollama) and streams a Knowledge Card over SSE.

## Sister service

Python Graph RAG `:8000` owns Neo4j, embeddings, ingest. Java never hits Neo4j or Orion at ask-time — only HTTP retrieve.

## Read first

- `docs/SPEC.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/contracts/`, `feature-document.md`

## Before changing

- Does this break the ask pipeline (interpret → semantic+graph → merge → synth)?
- Does this invent endpoints or change the SSE Knowledge Card contract?
- Does this pull Orion/Neo4j into Java? (must not)
- Follow existing package patterns: `chat/`, `clients/graphrag/`, `model/`, `adk/`, `merge/`, `config/`

## Docs

Update `README.md` / contracts when APIs, env vars, setup, or user-visible behavior change. Skip for pure refactors and test-only edits.

## Logs

Include `correlationId` when available. Never log tokens, prompts with secrets, or credentials.
